d. Electronic Brake System: Lioline Packers and Movers employs electronic brake systems on the trailers to ensure safe and controlled braking during transportation. These systems provide precise control over braking force to ensure safe stopping distances and avoid damage to the parcels during transit.

e. Sturdy Suspension System: The suspension system on the multi-axle trailers is designed to support the weight of two-wheeler parcels while ensuring a smooth ride for the transported vehicles. The suspension system comprises heavy-duty springs and shock absorbers, which mitigate vibrations and provide a stable platform for loading and unloading the parcels.

f. Safety Features:</div>
