<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Tamkuhi Raj Kushinagar | Safe Two-Wheeler Parcel
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad guarantee zero scratches during bike transportation in Tamkuhi Raj Kushinagar?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a patented 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging that combines heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard, weather‑proof stretch film, and custom wooden crates. Each bike is secured on a reinforced wooden pallet with high‑tensile ratchet lashings, and the hydraulic ramp loading ensures a smooth, impact‑free transfer onto our multi‑axle trailers, delivering a zero‑scratch guarantee.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What steps are involved in getting a bike transportation quote for a move from Tamkuhi Raj to a major hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Start by filling our online quote form or calling our local office. Provide bike make, model, dimensions, pickup and drop locations, and any special handling needs. Our system calculates base fare, distance surcharge (≈850 km), optional insurance, and any add‑ons such as extra padding. Within minutes you receive a transparent, itemized quote ready for confirmation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can premium or custom motorcycles be shipped using the hydraulic ramp trailers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our hydraulic ramp trailers feature adjustable loading platforms and reinforced tie‑down points designed for high‑value and custom bikes. The ramp’s smooth operation eliminates jolts, while the trailer’s multi‑axle suspension distributes weight evenly. Combined with our 7‑layer packaging and wooden pallet harness, even the most delicate finishes are protected throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does live GPS tracking work and what updates will I receive during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each trailer is equipped with a satellite‑linked GPS unit that streams location data to our control center. Customers receive real‑time updates via SMS or the mobile portal every 30 minutes, including current position, estimated arrival time, and any status changes such as loading, en‑route, or unloading. This transparency ensures you can monitor your bike’s progress from door‑step pickup to final delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is transit insurance mandatory for bike parcels, and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While not mandatory, we strongly recommend our IRDAI‑approved transit insurance for complete peace of mind. The policy covers accidental damage, theft, and loss up to the declared value of the bike. In the unlikely event of a claim, our dedicated claims team processes documentation within 48 hours and ensures prompt settlement, far exceeding the limited coverage offered by standard railway parcel services.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad’s bike parcel service compare with IRCTC or Indian Railway bike parcel options?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our service provides door‑to‑door pickup, hydraulic ramp loading, 7‑layer scratch‑proof packaging, live GPS tracking, and full‑value insurance—features not available with IRCTC or Indian Railway parcels, which rely on station‑to‑station handling and limited insurance. Additionally, our dedicated two‑wheeler carriers reduce transit time and eliminate multiple handling points, resulting in a safer, faster, and more reliable delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required to ship my bike from Tamkuhi Raj Kushinagar?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID, the bike’s registration certificate, a signed consignment note, and proof of ownership (sale invoice or insurance policy). If you opt for insurance, a declared value statement is required. Our team assists in preparing all paperwork and ensures compliance with GST, e‑Way bill, and IBA mover code regulations.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
